{"id":"e825d53bd327fe88","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-budget-set.md","title":"Budget Set","display":"df-budget-set — Budget Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-budget-set","aliases":["58-df-budget-set"],"display":"df-budget-set — Budget Set","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-inequality.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-budget-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-budget-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-budget-set — Budget Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ba1e97f4525d4ac\" href=\"?note=1ba1e97f4525d4ac\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-inequality.md\">../batch05/58-df-inequality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span>（商品种类数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}^n\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb{R}_{&gt;0}^n\\)</span>（严格为正的价格向量）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}\\)</span>（财富）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(p,m)\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\">\\(B(p,m)\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n\\)</span>（预算集）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}budget\\text{-}set} \\vdash B(p,m)\\coloneqq \\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}^n:p\\cdot x\\leq m\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}budget\\text{-}set} \\vdash B(p,m)\\coloneqq \\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}^n:p\\cdot x\\leq m\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget sets collect feasible commodity bundles under a linear price constraint.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-inequality.md","status":"resolved","id":"1ba1e97f4525d4ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-inequality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb{R}_{>0}^n","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}","display":false},{"tex":"B(p,m)\\subseteq\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}budget\\text{-}set} \\vdash B(p,m)\\coloneqq \\{x\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\geq0}^n:p\\cdot x\\leq m\\}","display":true}],"bytes":718,"backlinks":[{"id":"d67f64f2aefcc752","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B(\\mathbf p,m)=\\{\\mathbf x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^n:\\mathbf p\\cdot\\mathbf x\\leq m\\}$ (预算集, see [[../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-221","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-budget-set.md|58-df-budget-set]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["1ba1e97f4525d4ac","5045d216c83e75cb"]}